world Combo
title 综合世界：第一公里终点
intro 前五个世界的技巧在这里汇合。每一关都是一道完整的谜题。提示会越来越稀疏——是时候自己铺路了。
using: all
level 1
name 分配律反向
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), Or (And a b) (And a c) -> And a (Or b c)
hint: 前提是析取：cases 分两路（h1 : And a b / h2 : And a c）
hint: 左路：apply And.intro 拆目标为 a 和 Or b c——前者 exact (@And.left a b h1)，后者 apply Or.inl 再 exact (@And.right a b h1)
hint: 右路同理：h2 给出的是 c，所以 apply Or.inr 再 exact (@And.right a c h2)
solution:
intro a
intro b
intro c
intro h
cases h as h1 h2
apply And.intro
exact (@And.left a b h1)
apply Or.inl
exact (@And.right a b h1)
apply And.intro
exact (@And.left a c h2)
apply Or.inr
exact (@And.right a c h2)
---
level 2
name De Morgan 全量版
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), Iff (Not (Or a b)) (And (Not a) (Not b))
hint: Iff.intro 拆两方向
hint: 方向一：intro h 后 apply And.intro，两个目标各用 h (Or.inl ...) / h (Or.inr ...)
hint: 方向二：intro h 后 intro x，cases x 分两路，各用 And.left/And.right 投影
solution:
intro a
intro b
apply Iff.intro
intro h
apply And.intro
intro ha
exact h (Or.inl a b ha)
intro hb
exact h (Or.inr a b hb)
intro h
intro x
cases x as x1 x2
exact (@And.left (Not a) (Not b) h) x1
exact (@And.right (Not a) (Not b) h) x2
---
level 3
name 函数与合取
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), (Or a b -> c) -> And (a -> c) (b -> c)
hint: 前提 (Or a b -> c) 先 intro h 引入，再 apply And.intro 拆两目标
hint: 第一个 a -> c：intro ha 后 exact h (Or.inl a b ha)
hint: 第二个 b -> c：intro hb 后 exact h (Or.inr a b hb)
solution:
intro a
intro b
intro c
intro h
apply And.intro
intro ha
exact h (Or.inl a b ha)
intro hb
exact h (Or.inr a b hb)
variant: 反向——And (a -> c) (b -> c) -> Or a b -> c（cases + 投影）
---
level 4
name 合取的构造与应用
goal: forall (a : Prop), forall (b : Prop), forall (c : Prop), And (a -> b) (a -> c) -> a -> And b c
hint: intro h1、intro h3 —— 前提 h1 : And (a -> b) (a -> c)，h3 : a
hint: apply And.intro 后两个目标：And.left h1 h3 与 And.right h1 h3
solution:
intro a
intro b
intro c
intro h1
intro h3
apply And.intro
exact (@And.left (a -> b) (a -> c) h1) h3
exact (@And.right (a -> b) (a -> c) h1) h3
---
level 5
name 排中律的直觉主义版
goal: forall (a : Prop), Not (Not (Or a (Not a)))
hint: 经典排中律 a ∨ ¬a 直觉主义证不出来——但双重否定可以
hint: intro h 后目标 False。h 需要 Or a (Not a) 的证明：Or.inr 构造右路，其参数是 Not a
hint: Not a 就是 a -> False：用 Function.comp 把 h 和 Or.inl 组合（见 not_not_em）
solution:
intro a
intro h
exact h (Or.inr a (Not a) (@Function.comp.{0, 0, 0} a (Or a (Not a)) False h (@Or.inl a (Not a))))
